Rocq Hints:

core                # standard db
arith               # standard db
zarith              # standard db
bool                # standard db
datatypes           # standard db
sets                # standard db
typeclass_instances # standard db
fset                # standard db
ordered_type        # standard db

Print Hint *.
Print HintDb \ident.

Create HintDb \ident.
Hint Constants [Transparent | Opaque] : \db.   # resolution of constants.
Hint Projections [Transparent | Opaque] : \db. # resolution of projections.
Hint Variables [Transparent | Opaque] : \db.   # resolution of variables.


Hint Resolve \qualid \info : \db. # Add head symbol to hintdb.
Hint Resolve [ <- -> ] .. # Restricted direction.
Hint Immediate \qualid. # simple apply, solve trivial.
Hint Constructors \indType . # add inductive type ctors.
Hint Unfold \qualid. # allow unfolding definition.
Hint [Transparent Opaque] \qualid. # for resolution.
Hint Extern \nat \patt => \tactic : \db. # Extend auto with more than apply and unfold.
Hint Extern \nat \patt => progress \tactic : \db. # for tactics succeed without changing context.
Hint Cut [ \hintsRegex ] : \db. #
Hint Mode \qualid + : \db. # arg is input
Hint Mode \qualid ! : \db. # arg head is input
Hint Mode \qualid - : \db. # arg is output
Hint Rewrite [ <- -> ] \db.
Hint Rewrite [ <- -> ] \term using \tactic : \db.
